  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;In the\r\nabsence of a comprehensive ecology report and roost assessment, and given that\r\nthe site adjoins a Site of Importance for Nature Conservation, the impacts of\r\nthe proposal on existing biodiversity cannot be accurately assessed by the\r\nLocal Planning Authority, contrary to Policy G6 of the London Plan and Policy\r\nGI3 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment is located within surface water flood zone medium and High. In the\r\nabsence of a satisfactory Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been demonstrated\r\nthat the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within\r\nthe site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary\r\nto National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy SI 12 of The London Plan\r\n(2021 Policies CN3 and CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan CN3 and CN4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
